        "justification": "This is a high-impact, low-disruption solution. By preventing the incident (collision, grounding, catastrophic structural failure) in the first place through dynamic routing and predictive analytics, it achieves the highest possible reduction in risk. It is technologically feasible, cost-effective, highly scalable, and fully maintains transport continuity.",
        "total": 554
