        },
        "justification": "This idea provides near-perfect severity reduction by ensuring only a minimal volume can spill in any breach. However, implementing nested bladders fundamentally changes the vessel's cargo handling and capacity, severely impacting the constraint to maintain existing transport economics ('as-is' configuration).",
        "total": 408
