        "justification": "This solution focuses entirely on post-spill mitigation rather than prevention or immediate containment. While useful for long-term recovery, it does not address the immediate catastrophic environmental impact or reduce the severity of the initial event itself. Feasibility is moderate due to required R&D and regulatory hurdles for deploying microbes.",
